tation/smart-office-plan-153","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#控制逻辑","content":"离开后先进入低照度等待，再在延时结束后关闭；开放区、会议室和卫生间使用不同延时。"},"530":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-154","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#控制逻辑","content":"用户通过墙面开关手动操作后，该房间进入临时人工模式；直到人工超时、场景结束或确认无人后才恢复自动控制。"},"531":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-155","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#控制逻辑","content":"清扫、加班和活动场景必须显式启用，不能仅靠工作日时间表判断是否有人。"},"532":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-156","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#施工要求","content":"每个照明回路都必须能在控制平台离线时通过墙面开关控制。"},"533":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-157","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#施工要求","content":"大功率或多灯具回路由接触器/合适额定值的执行器驱动，不能使用小型无线模块直接承载全部负载。"},"534":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-158","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#施工要求","content":"调光灯具须确认驱动协议、最低亮度、频闪和断电恢复行为。"},"535":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-159","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#施工要求","content":"法定应急照明、疏散指示和消防联动保持独立。"},"536":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-160","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#分区原则","content":"一个房间不同朝向的窗户必须分组；同朝向连续窗可在电机容量允许时合并。"},"537":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-161","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#分区原则","content":"B 区东侧以早间遮阳为主，C 区西侧以午后防眩光和降温为主。"},"538":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-162","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#分区原则","content":"餐厅和前台以整体场景为主，独立办公室允许本地覆盖自动位置。"},"539":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-163","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#分区原则","content":"会议室进入演示场景时关闭窗帘，会议结束后恢复到进入场景前的位置。"},"540":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-164","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#控制与安全","content":"电机控制器必须实现“开/关互锁”，禁止正反转同时通电。"},"541":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-165","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#控制与安全","content":"优先选择具备位置反馈或行程反馈的电机；时间估算型电机应定期执行全开/全关校准。"},"542":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-166","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#控制与安全","content":"人员可触及的位置优先选用遇阻停止电机；强电供电与控制回路由具备相应资质的人员施工。"},"543":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-167","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#控制与安全","content":"墙面开、停、关按键直接接入控制器，本地操作优先于平台命令。"},"544":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-168","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#控制与安全","content":"自动遮阳后设置人工覆盖时间，避免用户刚打开窗帘又被规则立即关闭。"},"545":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-169","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#控制与安全","content":"窗帘供电、检修口和电机更换空间必须在吊顶施工前确认。"},"546":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-170","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#环境空调和能耗","content":"**空气质量**：会议室、开放区和餐厅根据 CO₂ 趋势联动新风或提醒开窗；阈值在试运行阶段根据人数和现场通风能力调校。"},"547":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-171","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#环境空调和能耗","content":"**空调**：人员存在只影响设定温度与运行模式，不直接频繁切断空调电源；短时离开保持，长时无人进入节能设定。"},"548":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-172","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#环境空调和能耗","content":"**机房**：温湿度、漏水、市电和 UPS 告警独立推送；自动化平台不得自动关闭核心设备。"},"549":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-173","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#环境空调和能耗","content":"**能耗**：至少分项计量照明、普通插座、空调/新风和机房；先建立基线，再调整下班和无人策略。"},"550":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-174","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#环境空调和能耗","content":"**餐饮区**：漏水、异常高温和燃气安全设备使用合规的独立报警器；平台只读取状态和通知，不取代本地声光报警或消防系统。"},"551":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-175","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"建议在现有 VLAN 10、20、99 基础上新增 **VLAN 30 Automation Services**："},"552":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-176","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"来源"},"553":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-177","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan#网络与安全","content":"目标"},"554":{"id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan-178","page_id":"/docs/implementation/smart-office-plan","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/implementation/sm